    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omunabii yabisulilwa akebisinyo ebiomuYerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho mumuyika kwakhasasaba, mumwesi kwakhasasaba, nikuli kharaano, olwa ndali ninzikhaale munzu yanje, nabo abakofu baYuda nibeekhaale imbeli wanje, habwenaho omukhono kwOmwami NYASAYE kwangwila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nindola, mbu ngwokwo, omufwano okwinga shinga okhulolekha khwomundu; okhurula khushialolekha shinga eshishienjeshie nokhutsia hasi, mbu omulilo; nokhurula khushishienjeshie nokhutsia ikulu, shinga okhulolekha khwokhwakha, shinga okhung'inang'ina khwomukasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanyiila likondo liomulkhono, niyandiila liswi liokhumurwe kwanje; Roho niyanjinga hakari weshialo nelikulu, niyambila mumabisulo kaNyasaye eYerusalemu, hamuliango kweshilibwa shiolwanyi olwomukari eshihenga enotsi; ebweneyo bwaliho obwikhalo bweshifwanani eshihambinjia imbalikha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lola, ing'oono yoluyali lwaNyasaye waIsiraeli yali niyiliho, shinga libisulo elia ndali ninduutsi nindi mumuhololookhwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana niyasunjila mbu Mwana womundu, bulaano chinguula tsimoni, ohenje enanotsi. Kho ninjinguula tsimoni nienga enanotsi, ne lola, shieshio, halubeka Iwenotsi Iweshilibwa shieshimalilo, eshifwanani eshihambinjia imbalikha tsana, nishili mubwinjililo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyasunjila ari Mwana womundu, kho oluutsi eshia bakhola? Mbu ebisinyo ebikhongo ebia abeinzu yaIsiraeli bakholanga hano, okhurusia ehale nahabundu wanje ahatakatifu? Ne witsa okhulola nende ebisinyo bindi ebikhongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana niyambila hamuliango kwolwanyi; ne olwa ndahenga, omuluhu ngwokwo mwisiisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyasunjila mbu Mwana womundu, bulaano oyabe mwisiisi. Ne olwa ndali niyabile mwisiisi, lola, omuliango ngwokwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyasunjila mbu Yinjila, olole ebisinyo ebibii ebia bakholelanga hano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho ninzinjila nindola; ne lola, mbiebio, mbu ebimoolanga hasi netsisolo tsiemisilo bietsimbia tsiosi, nemindu chiosi echiinamilungwa echieinzu yaIsiraeli, ebifwanani biabio nibing'oolelwa khwisiisi tsimbeka tsiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abandu amakhumi musaafu abokhubakofu beinzu yaIsiraeli bali nibasinjiile imbeli wabio, ne hakari wabwe Yaazania waShafani nasinjiile; buli mundu nali neshikayeshie skiamalesi kelibuuliesi mumukhono, ne eshiuya shiamalesi tsana nishituumuukha shinga lileesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana niyasunjila mbu Mwana womundu, kho oluutsi eshia abakofu beinzu yaIsiraeli bakholelanga mushiilima, buli mundu mushisikashie shiebifwanani? Okhuba baboolanga mbu OMWAMI shiakhulolanga ta; OMWAMI wayeebala eshialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi niyasunjila mbu Ne witsa okhulola nende ebisinyo bindi ebikhongo ebia bakholanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana niyambila hamuliango kweshilibwa shieinzu yOMWAMI eshili enanotsi; ne abakhasi mbabo, nibeekhaale nibalilila Tamuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana niyasunjila mbu Oluutsi, iwe omwana womundu? Witsa okhulola nende ebisinyo bindi ebishila ebio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyambila mulwanyi olwomukari Iweinzu yOMWAMI; ne hamuliango weihekalu yOMWAMI, hakari weshirookoola nende eshimalilo, abandu shinga amakhumi kabili nabaraano mbabo, nibafutariile ihekalu YOMWAMI, nibahenga ebukwe; nibeenamila eliuba enabukwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana niyasunjila mbu Kho oluutsi, mwana womundu? Nelikhuwa lituutu khubeinzu yaYuda okhukhola ebisinyo bino ebia bakholile hano noho? Okhuba beetsusiye eshialo amahababa, nibameeta okhusinyisia; kata lola, bareetsanga lisaka khumoolu kabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako ndalabakholela akobululu; imoni yanje shiyilabeelelela, kata shindalababeela tsimbabasi ta; ne kata nibalanjisia mumarwi kanje nomwoyo omukhongo, shindalabahulila ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
